{"id":"n62911-1-9","stage":5,"title":"서재 · 书斋","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62911-1-9-1","ko":"어머! 너 어디 있다가 이제야 나타나는 거니?","zh":"哎呀！你到底去哪儿了，现在才出现啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머!","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있다가","meaning":"过","explanation":"있다：过；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"4","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제야","meaning":"这才","explanation":"이제야：这才","readings":[{"term":"이제야","audio":"/audio/2be18ec567b0073f4c4c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24993","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나타나는","meaning":"出现，露面","explanation":"나타나다：出现，露面；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나타나다","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62286","senseId":"1","lemma":"나타나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"过","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68796","definition":"经历多少时间。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"2be18ec567b0073f","term":"이제야","zh":"这才","audio":"/audio/2be18ec567b0073f4c4c.mp3","entryId":"24993","definition":"说话的当时才。","pronunciation":["이제야"]},{"id":"d6fb8e71960ac802","term":"나타나다","zh":"出现，露面","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3","entryId":"62286","definition":"原本隐而不见的某个对象露出形貌。","pronunciation":["나타나다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/856c3d7a924b88ca2171.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62911-1-9-2","ko":"아, 저 하루 종일 서재에서 소설을 쓰고 있었어요.","zh":"啊，我一整天都在书房写小说呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"咦","explanation":"아：咦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"1","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하루","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"1","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"종일","meaning":"整天，一天到晚","explanation":"종일：整天，一天到晚","readings":[{"term":"종일","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91758","senseId":"1","lemma":"종일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서재에서","meaning":"书斋，书室，书房，书屋","explanation":"서재：书斋，书室，书房，书屋；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"서재","audio":"/audio/36bac580bace694ae1e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62911","senseId":"1","lemma":"서재","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소설을","meaning":"小说","explanation":"소설：小说；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소설","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32185","senseId":"1","lemma":"소설","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓰고","meaning":"写，创作","explanation":"쓰다：写，创作；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었어요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"从晚上12点到第二天晚上12点的24个小时。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"02f69fc1875bf310","term":"종일","zh":"整天，一天到晚","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3","entryId":"91758","definition":"从早晨到夜晚的时间段。","pronunciation":["종일"]},{"id":"36bac580bace694a","term":"서재","zh":"书斋，书室，书房，书屋","audio":"/audio/36bac580bace694ae1e8.mp3","entryId":"62911","definition":"配备书籍而用于读书写字的房间。","pronunciation":["서재"]},{"id":"88c77f43092f9156","term":"소설","zh":"小说","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3","entryId":"32185","definition":"作家虚构出来的、以故事形式写成的文学作品。","pronunciation":["소ː설"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写，创作","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"将头脑中的想法或感觉等用文字记在纸上而使其现出来。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/668303a589a1f8c114d9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.533,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62911","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":171,"sequenceScore":3.3597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["啊，我一整天都在书房写小说呢。","哎呀！你到底去哪儿了，现在才出现啊？","我想新订做一些家具。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["哎呀！你到底去哪儿了，现在才出现啊？","我想新订做一些家具。","啊，我一整天都在书房写小说呢。"],"answer":2}]}
